  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sir_kutree.jpg\" title=\"Tangled - Sir Kutree\"><img alt=\"Tangled - Sir Kutree\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"209\" src=\"/images/Sir_kutree.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Sir_kutree.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Tangled - Sir Kutree</div></div></div>\n<p>He is found somewhere on level 1 of <a href=\"/wiki/Vegrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vegrim's Vexation\">Vegrim's Vexation</a>. Through many builds, he seemed confused and just stood there and did nothing, but in Build 130 and later he is now both a quest object and a quest giver.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Sir_Kutree.27s_Quests\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Sir Kutree's Quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Audit_Vergrim's_Red_Tape\" title=\"Audit Vergrim's Red Tape\">Audit Vergrim's Red Tape</a>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
